        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Morgan, Janine Vaccarello\n- Organizations: Alcatraz East, National Museum of Crime & Punishment\n- Places: Pigeon Forge, Tennessee\n- Roles: attorney, Chief Operating Officer\n\nFacts:\n- John Morgan was born on March 31, 1956, and he is an American lawyer.\n- The National Museum of Crime & Punishment closed in 2015.\n- The National Museum of Crime & Punishment is now operated as Alcatraz East, a museum in Pigeon Forge, Tennessee.\n- Attorney John Morgan and Chief Operating Officer Janine Vaccarello created and built Alcatraz East.",
